<title>ITALY: Italy's Credito Emiliano to list by mid-October.</title>
<headline>Italy's Credito Emiliano to list by mid-October.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian bank Credito Emiliano is expected to list on the Milan stock market by the first half of October after finalising its merger with investment house Euromobiliare, a statement said.</p>
<p>Credem shareholders approved the merger with Euromobiliare at a meeting earlier on Thursday. The merged company will bear Credem's name.</p>
<p>The two companies announced in May the share swap ratio would be 13 Euromobiliare shares for each ordinary share of Credem.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +391 66129507</p>
</text>
